@host = http://localhost:5247

### Complete execution-ranked summary page (up to 50 kills); no roster/detail requests
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/illidan-stormrage?edition=anniversary&encounterId=50609&difficultyId=3

### Filters are validated but summaries stay complete; composition remains pending until inspected
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/illidan-stormrage?edition=anniversary&encounterId=50609&difficultyId=3&role=heal.gte.3&spec=holy-paladin.eq.0&killtime_min=120&killtime_max=600

### Next upstream summary page
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/illidan-stormrage?edition=anniversary&encounterId=50609&difficultyId=3&page=2

### Inspect exactly one fight: actual roster, composition, observed phases, cached boss reference
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/nB13CZbPKgD4J8rz/fights/30?edition=anniversary

### Refresh only the requested fight, not other rows
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/nB13CZbPKgD4J8rz/fights/30?edition=anniversary&refresh=true

### Refresh summary query only; details have independent refresh parameters
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/illidan-stormrage?edition=anniversary&encounterId=50609&difficultyId=3&refresh=true

### Invalid expression: 400 Problem Details, without an upstream call
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/illidan-stormrage?edition=anniversary&encounterId=50609&role=heal.invalid.2

### Invalid detail context: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/reports/ReportA/fights/0?edition=anniversary

### Missing required edition/encounter context: 400 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/rankings/comp/illidan-stormrage
